Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:28:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Host clock: a host feeds the external-clock grid directly

FELUCCA_HOST_CLOCK (off unless defined): with host_clock_on and an external CLOCK mode, events_block takes each
block's musical units from the board file's host_clock_units() instead of timestamped 24-ppqn pulses. The tempo
rescale moves from midi_clock_pulse into midi_clock_retempo(), which the host calls when its tempo changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SuSq9wGdniKSxRn9Ez2WpY
